  "entity_definitions": [
    {
      "definition_json": {
        "constraints": [
          {
            "fields": [
              "inventory_number"
            ],
            "name": "uq_assets_card_inventory_number",
            "type": "unique"
          },
          {
            "fields": [
              "external_ref_system",
              "external_ref_id"
            ],
            "name": "uq_assets_card_external_ref",
            "type": "unique"
          }
        ],
        "description": "GH #3894 / REQ-748, docs/assets/asset-register.md section 3, owner decision D-097, decisions 0050 D6, 0051 M4, 0076 R7. The asset card of module assets (Russian: Карточка актива; Kazakh: Актив карточкасы). One row per asset; the card holds no location, no responsible person, no actual user and no quantity: those live only in the register. inventory_number is unique per tenant (uq_assets_card_inventory_number). org_unit_id is the record_id of an org_unit of module org; it is another pack, so it has no foreign key and the write logic checks it. It is the scope column of the card (scope declaration {:column, org_unit_id}, immutable). kind is fixed, low_value or intangible. currency is optional text; the tenant currency is the module setting currency (KZT by default). The decimals are exact strings (decimal_strict) and information only. valid_until is allowed only for kind intangible (write rule, a later step). active false retires the card; there is no delete. external_ref_system and external_ref_id are the nullable import key, unique as a pair.",
        "display_name": "Asset card",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "inventory_number",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "name",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "enum_values": [
              "fixed",
              "low_value",
              "intangible"
            ],
            "name": "kind",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "enum"
          },
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "acquisition_date",
            "type": "date"
          },
          {
            "name": "currency",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "decimal_precision": 24,
            "decimal_scale": 9,
            "decimal_strict": true,
            "name": "acquisition_cost",
            "type": "decimal"
          },
          {
            "decimal_precision": 24,
            "decimal_scale": 9,
            "decimal_strict": true,
            "name": "accumulated_depreciation",
            "type": "decimal"
          },
          {
            "decimal_precision": 24,
            "decimal_scale": 9,
            "decimal_strict": true,
            "name": "book_value",
            "type": "decimal"
          },
          {
            "name": "depreciation_as_of",
            "type": "date"
          },
          {
            "name": "valid_until",
            "queried": true,
            "type": "date"
          },
          {
            "name": "active",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "name": "external_ref_system",
            "queried": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "external_ref_id",
            "queried": true,
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "name": "assets_card"
      },
      "display_name": "Asset card",
      "entity_definition_id": "1cdfbd2c-8b56-31a6-5aab-9eec562480bd",
      "logical_shape_version": "f1bf5a491e09c88f66d2a5bd18426e88bae98392a484d8fcff70f2bf59992381",
      "name": "assets_card"
    },
    {
      "definition_json": {
        "description": "GH #3891 / REQ-751 (assets C10), docs/assets/asset-workflow-documents.md sections 1 and 2. The header of an asset commission document (putting assets into the register). It is written only by module assets (managed type). document_id is the id of the versioned document of Letflow.Documents (decision 0056) that carries the state, the gap-free number and the issued time: no number, status or posted time is stored here (they are read from the versioned document and the posting mark). org_unit_id is the issuing org unit (queried; the scope column of decision 0076 R7). event_time is the time of the commissioning, ISO 8601 with offset, stored in UTC. location_id, material_responsible_id and actual_user_id are record ids of modules locations and org (other packs: no foreign key; the module checks them at issue). After issue nothing of the header changes.",
        "display_name": "Asset commission (header)",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "document_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "event_time",
            "required": true,
            "type": "datetime"
          },
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "location_id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "material_responsible_id",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "actual_user_id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "note",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "indexes": [
          {
            "fields": [
              "document_id"
            ],
            "name": "idx_assets_commission_document_id"
          }
        ],
        "name": "assets_commission"
      },
      "display_name": "Asset commission (header)",
      "entity_definition_id": "304df40e-bc77-68c3-ab99-86f26d3f8563",
      "logical_shape_version": "361c3212087a7b86a8e59443800b34f4d690101c111bb20c7a81caaf5a60a3a1",
      "name": "assets_commission"
    },
    {
      "definition_json": {
        "description": "GH #3891 / REQ-751 (assets C10), docs/assets/asset-workflow-documents.md sections 1 and 2. One line of an asset commission: one asset card and a quantity. header_id is the record_id of the assets_commission header (not the document id); the foreign_keys entry fk_assets_commission_line_header_id promotes it to a uuid column with ON DELETE RESTRICT (inert on the soft-delete path). org_unit_id is the header's value copied by the module (queried; the scope column of decision 0076 R7, so a scoped read can filter lines). line_no is the position 1..n. asset_id is the record id of an assets_card. quantity is an exact decimal (precision 24, scale 9, decimal_strict); the value rule (whole number, 1 for fixed and intangible assets) is checked at issue. Written only by module assets; after issue nothing of a line changes.",
        "display_name": "Asset commission (line)",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "header_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "line_no",
            "required": true,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          {
            "name": "asset_id",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "decimal_precision": 24,
            "decimal_scale": 9,
            "decimal_strict": true,
            "name": "quantity",
            "required": true,
            "type": "decimal"
          }
        ],
        "foreign_keys": [
          {
            "field": "header_id",
            "name": "fk_assets_commission_line_header_id",
            "references_entity": "assets_commission"
          }
        ],
        "indexes": [
          {
            "fields": [
              "header_id"
            ],
            "name": "idx_assets_commission_line_header_id"
          }
        ],
        "name": "assets_commission_line"
      },
      "display_name": "Asset commission (line)",
      "entity_definition_id": "e63ce895-75e1-0901-9226-d001c5bf7825",
      "logical_shape_version": "83d8cecc34d7e00cbf097c6bf533d48c1433dffc6af4ce935b9815637a93821e",
